Package: automsm
Title: Automatic Targeted estimators of Non-parametric Marginal Structural Models
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Herbert", "Susmann", , "herbps10@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Targeted estimation for a general class of Non-parametric Marginal Structural Models (NP-MSMs). An NP-MSM summarizes a high-dimensional target functional (such as a conditional average treatment effect) by projecting it onto a lower-dimensional working model with respect to a loss function, without assuming the working model is correctly specified. Arbitrary working models and loss functions are supported via automatic differentiation.
